WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.370 --> 01:46.920
=Episode 5=

01:49.280 --> 01:50.950
Jinzhao told me

01:51.120 --> 01:53.120
there should be no secrets
between friends.

01:53.750 --> 01:55.240
Since we are friends now,

01:55.590 --> 01:57.920
I want to tell you something.

01:59.479 --> 02:01.230
Okay, please.

02:04.320 --> 02:05.350
I found

02:06.120 --> 02:07.370
Physician Bian

02:08.070 --> 02:09.590
so approachable

02:09.750 --> 02:11.320
the first time I saw him.

02:11.430 --> 02:12.910
I think he resembles Jinzhao.

02:13.480 --> 02:14.990
Physician Bian resembles Yue?

02:17.070 --> 02:18.000
Yes,

02:19.070 --> 02:20.430
but not exactly.

02:22.160 --> 02:23.690
Just like...

02:26.000 --> 02:29.800
Just like the difference
between a vegetable bun and a meat bun.

02:30.280 --> 02:32.070
Although they are all buns,

02:32.430 --> 02:34.640
the fillings are different.

02:38.520 --> 02:40.680
Yue is unruly and perceptive,

02:41.230 --> 02:42.750
while Physician Bian...

02:44.750 --> 02:45.750
Anyway, in my opinion,

02:45.870 --> 02:47.280
they are completely different.

02:47.870 --> 02:48.960
Maybe you've seen

02:49.079 --> 02:50.590
Physician Bian before.

02:52.640 --> 02:53.470
I don't think so.

02:57.640 --> 02:58.510
Miss Yue.

02:59.510 --> 03:02.250
Have you ever heard of Rehai before?

03:05.470 --> 03:06.760
(The matter of Rehai is confidential.)

03:07.080 --> 03:08.320
(Don't tell anyone.)

03:18.910 --> 03:19.720
Then, Miss Yue,

03:20.230 --> 03:23.110
is there anything special about you?

03:24.280 --> 03:26.910
I'm specially smart and clever.

03:28.760 --> 03:30.400
Anything else?

03:32.680 --> 03:33.870
No, then.

03:37.640 --> 03:38.400
Trust among friends.

03:38.550 --> 03:39.720
This is the last time.

03:40.230 --> 03:42.079
But I have one more favor to ask.

03:42.720 --> 03:43.760
Can you not tell anyone

03:44.440 --> 03:45.829
that I asked you questions?

03:45.910 --> 03:46.680
Why?

03:49.190 --> 03:51.040
This matters to me.

03:51.150 --> 03:52.750
Please keep it a secret

03:52.910 --> 03:53.950
and do not tell anyone.

03:54.360 --> 03:55.800
Alright, deal.

03:55.910 --> 03:57.390
Zhaoyan, you've been good to us.

03:57.550 --> 03:59.470
I won't tell Jinzhao if he doesn't ask.

04:02.470 --> 04:04.440
But if Yue asks,

04:04.880 --> 04:06.080
do not tell him, either.

04:06.190 --> 04:06.750
Is that okay?

04:07.360 --> 04:08.360
No way.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.720
If Jinzhao asks me,

04:09.910 --> 04:11.190
I would definitely tell.

04:16.160 --> 04:16.640
Well...

04:16.750 --> 04:17.550
Sorry.

04:17.829 --> 04:19.190
I got held up

04:19.310 --> 04:20.279
by the villagers.

04:20.640 --> 04:21.640
Is the wounded one okay?

04:24.160 --> 04:24.720
Yes.

04:32.550 --> 04:33.670
Zhaoyan, what's wrong with you?

04:34.310 --> 04:35.110
Let me check.

04:36.950 --> 04:38.080
Don't bother, Physician Bian.

04:38.280 --> 04:39.110
Just an old illness.

04:39.750 --> 04:42.110
Don't you trust my medical skills?

04:44.440 --> 04:45.080
Zhaoyan.

04:45.190 --> 04:47.360
You should let
Physician Bian check on you.

04:54.030 --> 04:55.080
Then please, Physician Bian.

05:01.520 --> 05:02.800
You seem to be in a condition

05:03.520 --> 05:04.880
I've never seen before.

05:06.670 --> 05:07.190
It's okay.

05:07.910 --> 05:09.080
I just need a rest.

05:09.440 --> 05:09.950
Thank you.

05:21.360 --> 05:21.950
I'm fine.

05:23.440 --> 05:24.910
(There are no physical abnormalities,)

05:25.950 --> 05:28.360
(yet the life force
is flowing out of the body.)

05:29.640 --> 05:31.470
(Is it the curse)

05:31.750 --> 05:33.520
(of the Twilight Luo family's
twins dying young?)

05:35.159 --> 05:36.640
No more nagging.

05:36.640 --> 05:38.159
I'm telling you. You all heard it.

05:38.280 --> 05:39.280
Physician Bian said

05:39.390 --> 05:40.600
everything will all be clear

05:40.720 --> 05:41.800
when these patients wake up.

05:42.159 --> 05:43.909
Don't be timid all the time.

05:44.110 --> 05:45.000
Even if you don't trust him,

05:45.000 --> 05:46.240
you have to trust me, right?

05:46.310 --> 05:47.159
Yes.

05:47.470 --> 05:48.310
With me here,

05:48.440 --> 05:49.360
nothing to worry about.

05:49.640 --> 05:52.310
Everything's ready. We just need
to wait for the fish to bite.

05:53.159 --> 05:54.880
Jinzhao, will this really work?

05:55.000 --> 05:55.750
Of course.

05:56.110 --> 05:57.000
The wounded man

05:57.110 --> 05:58.240
attracted their attention.

05:59.280 --> 06:00.280
To cover up the crime,

06:00.630 --> 06:02.630
they'll take action.

06:04.480 --> 06:04.920
Miss Ming.

06:05.390 --> 06:06.200
Senior Xian Qing.

06:06.550 --> 06:07.920
Did you take a stroll?

06:09.830 --> 06:10.230
Yes.

06:10.600 --> 06:12.550
I'm getting old. Taking a stroll
could help the digestion.

06:13.320 --> 06:14.510
We've already found a place to stay.

06:14.950 --> 06:15.950
Let's pick up Luo and Qi.

06:22.830 --> 06:23.390
Look,

06:23.480 --> 06:25.280
I drew a map of the whole village.

06:26.160 --> 06:28.230
What's this?

06:29.720 --> 06:30.920
This triangle

06:30.920 --> 06:31.670
represents a house.

06:31.950 --> 06:33.670
This circle represents a cave.

06:35.880 --> 06:38.000
So where are we now?

06:39.480 --> 06:41.790
This is our current location.

06:42.200 --> 06:44.440
This is Physician Bian's cottage, right?

06:45.280 --> 06:46.280
Yes, correct.

06:47.070 --> 06:49.630
Shifang, your map
is really easy to understand.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.790
Okay, then

06:55.480 --> 06:58.040
we'll hide near Bian Luohuan's house.

06:58.159 --> 06:59.350
Wait until they take action,

06:59.480 --> 07:00.760
and we can surround them.

07:01.440 --> 07:04.160
Yue, I wouldn't recommend
catching them in the village.

07:04.280 --> 07:04.880
It's dangerous.

07:05.070 --> 07:06.880
I'm afraid it'd hurt villagers.

07:07.600 --> 07:09.110
Then let's drive them to Linyang Road.

07:09.720 --> 07:12.950
Luo, Shifang, and Senior Xian Qing,

07:13.070 --> 07:14.280
you would be waiting there.

07:14.390 --> 07:16.160
Qi, me, and Miss Ming,

07:16.600 --> 07:18.000
we'll be guarding
near Bian Luohuan's house.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.160
Okay.

07:19.600 --> 07:21.000
I'll stay to protect Physician Bian.

07:21.480 --> 07:22.160
No way.

07:28.070 --> 07:29.360
Well, I mean...

07:30.630 --> 07:31.550
Are you sure?

07:32.110 --> 07:32.880
Yes.

07:38.040 --> 07:38.720
Jinzhao.

07:38.950 --> 07:39.720
You don't want me

07:39.830 --> 07:42.320
to stay and protect
Physician Bian, do you?

07:42.510 --> 07:43.200
Not at all.

07:44.320 --> 07:47.350
I just wonder if you can do it.

07:47.670 --> 07:49.280
If I can't, can you?

07:51.760 --> 07:53.070
Now that it's all set up,

07:53.159 --> 07:54.790
let's go back and get some rest.

07:57.630 --> 07:58.159
Okay.

08:42.919 --> 08:45.720
Physician Bian,
did we know each other before?

08:46.350 --> 08:47.110
Maybe.

08:52.550 --> 08:54.920
Thinking of Qi is enough,

08:56.200 --> 08:59.160
but why is this Bian Luohuan
getting into my head too?

09:01.480 --> 09:03.280
It's quite weird.

09:10.040 --> 09:11.180
Jinzhao, do you have water?

09:12.040 --> 09:12.830
I'm in a medicated bath.

09:14.320 --> 09:15.200
Close your eyes.

09:16.510 --> 09:18.160
Then why didn't you shut the door?

09:18.320 --> 09:19.480
Then why didn't you knock?

09:21.920 --> 09:22.670
Don't open your eyes.

09:49.870 --> 09:52.810
♪Looking back♪

09:53.710 --> 09:56.620
♪I try to bring back memories♪

09:56.950 --> 09:58.070
Are you thirsty too?

10:01.870 --> 10:04.100
♪It's meant to be♪

10:05.160 --> 10:07.630
Qi, you go out now.

10:08.880 --> 10:10.000
Why?

10:10.350 --> 10:11.880
You are dressed, right?

10:12.480 --> 10:13.830
Do you have water?

10:13.950 --> 10:15.310
I'm really thirsty.

10:16.510 --> 10:17.600
Knock the door

10:17.720 --> 10:19.240
before you enter someone's room.

10:19.750 --> 10:21.070
You are not someone.

10:24.620 --> 10:27.920
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

10:28.590 --> 10:30.220
♪The past glided before my mind♪

10:30.220 --> 10:31.990
♪I smiled and cried♪

10:31.990 --> 10:33.160
Jinzhao.

10:33.160 --> 10:35.750
You look like a young lady.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.090
Indeed.

10:38.310 --> 10:40.510
You look exactly like those young ladies

10:40.630 --> 10:42.280
I read in storybooks

10:42.390 --> 10:43.800
when they are seen bathing.

10:43.950 --> 10:45.280
When they are seen,

10:45.390 --> 10:46.600
they are either outraged

10:46.870 --> 10:48.480
or embarrassed.

10:50.160 --> 10:52.950
Look at you, so embarrassed, right?

10:54.090 --> 10:57.390
♪I've been looking for you♪

10:57.390 --> 10:58.120
Jinzhao.

10:58.920 --> 10:59.630
You got me wet.

10:59.750 --> 11:01.000
I'm not playing with you anymore.

11:02.700 --> 11:04.170
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

11:04.170 --> 11:06.380
♪I engrave your name♪

11:06.380 --> 11:12.680
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

11:19.680 --> 11:20.360
Qi.

11:22.390 --> 11:23.240
Would you

11:24.800 --> 11:26.120
wipe someone else's head like this?

11:28.360 --> 11:29.100
No.

11:31.240 --> 11:31.870
Why?

11:34.040 --> 11:36.830
Because Zhaoyan has a younger sister,

11:37.920 --> 11:39.190
Shifang has Dou Bao,

11:40.600 --> 11:42.160
and Ming Xiu has Xian Qing.

11:42.990 --> 11:44.280
You're pathetic

11:44.280 --> 11:46.950
to be alone. So there's only me.

11:48.310 --> 11:49.600
I am not pathetic at all.

11:50.950 --> 11:51.800
I still have myself.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.360
What a young lady.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.920
Shut up.

12:03.160 --> 12:05.600
Here's the water. Drink it.

12:12.600 --> 12:13.630
Nice.

12:14.040 --> 12:14.750
Come on.

12:15.360 --> 12:18.430
Qi, why do you love
drinking water so much?

12:19.070 --> 12:21.280
Jinzhao, can you make
a straw-woven butterfly?

12:21.510 --> 12:22.280
No.

12:22.800 --> 12:24.720
Why do you ask?

12:25.310 --> 12:26.430
In Physician Bian's cottage,

12:26.510 --> 12:28.240
there are many beautiful
straw-woven butterflies.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.750
I want one too.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.120
No men would like things

12:33.120 --> 12:34.680
that only girls would make.

12:35.680 --> 12:36.950
Then I'll ask Physician Bian for one.

12:41.800 --> 12:44.800
Since when are you so close
to Physician Bian?

12:44.950 --> 12:46.160
Didn't I tell you many times

12:46.360 --> 12:48.190
not to talk to strangers?

12:48.480 --> 12:50.310
I have been close to him all the time.

12:50.430 --> 12:51.430
I think Physician Bian

12:51.510 --> 12:53.560
feels very much like
what you made me feel.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.430
So I find him approachable.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.330
Are you alright, Jinzhao?

13:07.950 --> 13:08.510
Nothing.

13:09.800 --> 13:10.190
By the way,

13:11.480 --> 13:13.120
when you were guarding
Physician Bian's house,

13:13.480 --> 13:14.680
did you notice anything weird?

13:16.990 --> 13:18.510
Do you mean Physician Bian or Zhaoyan?

13:18.750 --> 13:19.310
Physician Bian.

13:20.950 --> 13:21.600
What about Zhaoyan?

13:23.160 --> 13:23.560
Yes.

13:23.720 --> 13:24.280
What is it?

13:25.870 --> 13:26.990
He apologized to me.

13:27.240 --> 13:29.390
He said "we are friends now".

13:34.070 --> 13:35.560
Then he is quite clever,

13:35.630 --> 13:37.160
much better than his younger sister.

13:38.280 --> 13:40.990
He also asked me if I knew about Rehai.

13:43.560 --> 13:44.430
Rehai?

13:45.740 --> 13:47.470
(Rehai)

13:49.390 --> 13:50.480
What did you answer?

13:51.190 --> 13:52.830
You told me to keep it a secret,

13:53.070 --> 13:54.560
so I said I didn't know.

13:55.280 --> 13:55.980
However,

13:56.830 --> 13:58.870
Zhaoyan also told me
to keep it a secret.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.990
Zhaoyan asked you to keep it a secret.

14:03.390 --> 14:04.480
Why did you tell me?

14:05.120 --> 14:06.070
I promised him

14:06.190 --> 14:07.680
I wouldn't tell you if you don't ask.

14:07.990 --> 14:08.830
Since you've asked,

14:09.040 --> 14:10.390
I can't lie to you.

14:11.160 --> 14:11.950
Good.

14:13.190 --> 14:13.990
Here, have some water.

14:23.190 --> 14:24.800
Are you enjoying the beautiful scenery?

14:25.950 --> 14:26.480
Senior.

14:28.950 --> 14:29.560
Not really.

14:33.600 --> 14:36.360
So you are concerned
about tonight's operation.

14:41.040 --> 14:42.090
We have limited manpower.

14:42.390 --> 14:44.070
If tonight's operation fails,

14:44.510 --> 14:46.240
Physician Bian and that patient

14:46.360 --> 14:47.430
might both be in danger.

14:48.870 --> 14:50.510
Didn't you agree

14:50.750 --> 14:52.360
on this plan?

14:54.560 --> 14:55.750
For something you've decided,

14:56.240 --> 14:57.800
if you hesitate halfway...

14:59.510 --> 15:00.070
Zhaoyan,

15:00.920 --> 15:02.120
this is what a hypocrite would do.

15:06.990 --> 15:07.950
What you said

15:08.920 --> 15:10.630
is very similar to
what one of my family said.

15:11.990 --> 15:12.720
Perhaps

15:13.830 --> 15:15.070
as he said,

15:15.720 --> 15:16.990
I am a hypocrite.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.800
It's been a long time since
I've seen someone so innocent.

15:25.070 --> 15:26.240
You are funny and adorable.

15:29.280 --> 15:30.360
A-Adorable?

15:32.950 --> 15:33.680
Senior.

15:34.430 --> 15:36.870
Adorable is not a word for me.

16:00.560 --> 16:01.750
We must not lose

16:02.160 --> 16:03.240
against Qiyuan Sect today.

16:03.600 --> 16:04.560
Of course.

16:05.390 --> 16:05.920
Let's go.

16:27.800 --> 16:28.390
(Luo,)

16:29.070 --> 16:29.990
(I'm going to need you)

16:30.430 --> 16:31.750
(to wait with me tonight.)

16:33.630 --> 16:35.920
(Miss Ming, Senior, and Shifang,)

16:36.600 --> 16:37.920
(you guys ambush at Linyang Road.)

16:38.190 --> 16:39.920
(After Luo and I lure them over,)

16:40.040 --> 16:41.480
(you'd come out to fight.)

16:42.990 --> 16:45.310
(Qi, you'd keep an eye on Bian Luohuan)

16:45.600 --> 16:46.990
(and come to us if you get a chance.)

16:47.560 --> 16:49.390
(If you encounter
a strong opponent on the way,)

16:49.750 --> 16:50.800
(don't try to be brave.)

16:50.950 --> 16:51.830
(Run if you can't win.)

17:01.160 --> 17:02.280
We've been waiting for you.

17:02.950 --> 17:03.750
Surround them.

17:06.750 --> 17:07.920
It's a trap. Retreat.

17:09.310 --> 17:09.869
Qi.

17:10.599 --> 17:11.339
I'll protect this place.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.680
(Why am I suddenly so sleepy?)

17:22.599 --> 17:25.319
(Why can't I open my eyes?)

17:57.240 --> 18:00.390
Jinzhao, stealing my eggs again.

18:47.680 --> 18:48.440
Demon!

19:00.470 --> 19:01.590
How dare you run wild here.

19:07.630 --> 19:08.510
Miss Ming, no.

19:10.750 --> 19:12.080
Mr. Ju, do you know this demon?

19:12.280 --> 19:13.230
Why did you help her?

19:14.470 --> 19:15.710
Shuo Xuan is a demon?

19:38.230 --> 19:39.590
Keep running.

19:42.680 --> 19:43.350
Where's Shifang?

19:44.110 --> 19:45.560
Shifang has been captured by a demon.

19:46.510 --> 19:47.200
I'll take a look.

19:51.200 --> 19:51.840
Wait.

19:53.590 --> 19:54.590
Shuo Xuan.

19:55.320 --> 19:56.080
Are you

19:57.110 --> 19:59.080
a good demon or a bad one?

19:59.350 --> 20:00.440
Junk doesn't deserve to know.

20:01.630 --> 20:02.750
I'm not junk.

20:03.630 --> 20:05.990
I just don't want to fight you.

20:10.390 --> 20:11.470
Shuo Xuan.

20:12.390 --> 20:13.470
Do you want to kill me?

20:14.920 --> 20:15.920
I don't need

20:16.680 --> 20:18.160
to kill you myself.

20:19.040 --> 20:20.990
D-Do you

20:21.990 --> 20:23.750
really have something to do
with Qiyuan Sect?

20:24.840 --> 20:26.920
Qiyuan Sect is just a small sect.

20:27.080 --> 20:28.200
I really don't care.

20:28.990 --> 20:30.440
You have been tricked
into harming others

20:30.510 --> 20:32.080
by the Qiyuan Sect.

20:32.200 --> 20:33.110
Just drop your weapon

20:33.200 --> 20:34.230
and tell us who's behind it,

20:34.680 --> 20:35.680
so you'd make amends.

20:36.110 --> 20:37.080
Harming others?

20:37.800 --> 20:40.750
How dare you
ruin the reputation of Qiyuan Sect!

20:41.160 --> 20:42.080
Stubborn.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.680
Bros, attack!

21:06.080 --> 21:06.870
It's you.

21:08.110 --> 21:08.840
Shuo Xuan.

21:10.320 --> 21:11.230
If one day,

21:11.840 --> 21:12.990
you and I become enemies,

21:14.110 --> 21:16.630
I-I will definitely beat you

21:16.870 --> 21:18.080
and lead you onto the right path.

21:21.560 --> 21:23.200
You are such a dreamer.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.440
How could you beat me

21:27.110 --> 21:28.630
with those shoddy gadgets?

21:30.390 --> 21:31.280
Do you deserve it?

21:32.110 --> 21:32.630
One more thing,

21:35.040 --> 21:35.840
what is the right path?

21:37.470 --> 21:39.200
You and I are not of the same kind.

21:45.080 --> 21:45.750
From now on,

21:47.920 --> 21:49.110
stay away from me.

21:50.710 --> 21:51.280
Shifang.

21:57.800 --> 21:59.320
How are you doing? Are you okay?

22:00.560 --> 22:01.280
I'm okay.

22:01.440 --> 22:02.750
Shuo Xuan did not hurt me.

22:02.960 --> 22:03.840
Shuo Xuan?

22:04.920 --> 22:05.590
She's a demon?

22:07.710 --> 22:08.870
She's already gone.

22:11.320 --> 22:13.280
Last time,
she paid special attention to Qi.

22:13.390 --> 22:14.560
It's her again.

22:14.960 --> 22:15.870
Next time I see her,

22:16.350 --> 22:17.350
I have to ask her.

22:17.990 --> 22:19.710
Let's go find Luo.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.750
Oh no. We've been exposed.

22:25.350 --> 22:26.280
That person will kill us.

22:26.510 --> 22:27.590
Let's just be honest.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.110
Leave him alive.

22:45.470 --> 22:46.870
May Lord Ming bless us.

23:14.320 --> 23:16.870
I am responsible for keeping
an eye on Qi and Yue Jinzhao,

23:17.320 --> 23:18.040
not you.

23:19.710 --> 23:21.280
Do you think I'm willing to do that?

23:23.960 --> 23:25.630
You exposed yourself at Jincui Oasis,

23:25.990 --> 23:28.040
which aroused Yue Jinzhao
to suspect you.

23:29.080 --> 23:30.200
If you interfere again,

23:31.990 --> 23:33.350
I won't show any mercy.

24:11.750 --> 24:12.960
Why did I fall asleep?

24:17.110 --> 24:17.750
Physician Bian.

24:18.710 --> 24:19.320
Physician Bian.

24:19.630 --> 24:21.390
Let me check.

24:22.080 --> 24:22.840
Are you okay?

24:27.280 --> 24:27.920
Good then.

24:28.990 --> 24:29.680
What about him?

24:31.280 --> 24:31.990
He'll wake up soon.

24:34.510 --> 24:35.320
What about Jinzhao?

24:35.320 --> 24:36.710
Why aren't they back yet?

24:40.870 --> 24:42.960
Are they in some kind of danger?

24:43.560 --> 24:46.160
As expected, he can't do it
without my protection.

24:47.470 --> 24:48.590
What an idiot.

24:50.750 --> 24:51.510
Pathetic.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.230
Why is someone dead?

24:54.110 --> 24:55.080
What happened?

24:59.320 --> 25:00.630
Jinzhao, are you okay?

25:00.960 --> 25:02.390
How could I get injured so easily?

25:02.590 --> 25:02.990
Come on.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.280
Zhuo.

25:06.920 --> 25:08.200
Zhuo.

25:13.200 --> 25:16.870
My son!

25:19.870 --> 25:21.870
Shifang, you don't look so well.

25:22.080 --> 25:22.990
Are you injured?

25:23.560 --> 25:24.200
No.

25:25.040 --> 25:27.800
I saw a lot of people dead.

25:28.990 --> 25:30.990
I just wanted to catch them,

25:31.390 --> 25:33.990
but I didn't expect
I would drive them to death.

25:34.470 --> 25:35.840
I caused them to die.

25:36.200 --> 25:36.960
Mr. Ju.

25:37.280 --> 25:38.630
As the head of Zhengwu Alliance,

25:38.800 --> 25:40.230
you should kill demons and evils.

25:40.350 --> 25:41.280
Still afraid of these?

25:42.510 --> 25:43.750
I'm not.

25:44.280 --> 25:45.110
But...

25:45.510 --> 25:47.990
They were all living beings.

25:51.350 --> 25:53.990
It's you who caused them to die.

25:54.390 --> 25:55.800
It's them. Definitely them.

25:55.840 --> 25:56.960
Right, it must be them.

25:56.990 --> 25:58.750
I knew it. It's them.

25:59.440 --> 26:00.200
- It's them.
- It's them.

26:00.230 --> 26:00.990
- It's them.
- It's them.

26:02.710 --> 26:04.160
You wicked people!

26:05.920 --> 26:07.350
They had it coming.

26:07.630 --> 26:08.750
You dare to blame us?

26:09.560 --> 26:11.280
Aren't you meant

26:11.510 --> 26:13.080
to hurt us here?

26:13.440 --> 26:15.630
- Exactly.
- They are here to hurt us.

26:16.140 --> 26:16.870
- It's you.
- It's you.

26:16.870 --> 26:18.710
Sir, please hear me out.

26:19.200 --> 26:20.040
We came here

26:20.280 --> 26:22.710
because we knew this might
be the stronghold of Qiyuan Sect.

26:22.920 --> 26:23.800
And the people who died

26:23.960 --> 26:24.990
were the people of Qiyuan Sect.

26:25.440 --> 26:27.560
So they deserve to die?

26:27.630 --> 26:29.560
No, we were trying to lure them out

26:29.630 --> 26:30.390
and capture them,

26:30.590 --> 26:32.350
but unexpectedly,
they all killed themselves.

26:32.800 --> 26:34.680
Perhaps we should
go check their houses together

26:34.990 --> 26:35.920
to look for any clues.

26:36.280 --> 26:37.590
Yue, there's no need to explain.

26:38.440 --> 26:40.230
This is caused by me.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.350
It's my fault I didn't stop them

26:42.470 --> 26:43.470
from killing themselves.

26:43.840 --> 26:44.470
Everyone,

26:44.750 --> 26:46.320
I'm willing to bear all your grief

26:46.990 --> 26:47.960
and anger.

26:48.390 --> 26:51.200
You bear it?

26:51.510 --> 26:53.200
Can you bring them back to life?

26:53.960 --> 26:56.320
Yes, can you bring them back to life?

26:56.470 --> 26:58.160
Can you bring them back to life?

26:58.470 --> 27:00.630
- Right.
- He's a man of words.

27:02.200 --> 27:04.560
Zhaoyan, no need
to talk to them anymore.

27:06.390 --> 27:07.040
Everyone,

27:09.110 --> 27:12.990
I suppose you are the heroes
who saved me.

27:15.040 --> 27:15.960
Why are you out?

27:16.230 --> 27:17.160
Are you okay?

27:17.870 --> 27:19.110
I am much better now.

27:19.800 --> 27:21.350
If you don't clarify the situation,

27:21.680 --> 27:23.160
the heroes will be in danger.

27:26.040 --> 27:26.960
Everyone, listen to me.

27:27.510 --> 27:28.280
My name is Lang Mo.

27:29.440 --> 27:32.710
I am a businessman who came
from Mangwan Village to Yinghui Fort.

27:35.040 --> 27:37.230
People of Qiyuan Sect knocked me out

27:37.750 --> 27:39.110
and then locked me up.

27:41.390 --> 27:42.750
There were a lot of other people

27:43.350 --> 27:44.470
locked up with me.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.440
It's them.

27:47.800 --> 27:48.390
Impossible.

27:50.040 --> 27:50.750
Impossible.

27:50.750 --> 27:52.430
I wonder what happened to them.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.470
Heroes,

27:56.470 --> 27:57.800
please go save them.

27:59.080 --> 28:00.470
Are you telling the truth?

28:02.630 --> 28:03.750
I'll bet my life on it.

28:05.160 --> 28:07.680
It seems to be true.

28:09.110 --> 28:09.800
It seems to be true.

28:09.840 --> 28:12.840
Fine, so be it.

28:14.920 --> 28:19.470
I'll let you take a look at Zhuo's room.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.080
Let's go.

28:22.870 --> 28:24.160
- Go, take a look.
- Let's take a look.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.630
We can tell the truth then.

28:26.680 --> 28:27.390
Just take a look.

28:27.870 --> 28:28.560
Are you okay?

28:31.080 --> 28:32.870
Lang Mo, I'll take you to the cottage.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.750
I can go back myself.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.750
Master Luo, you go ahead.

29:10.630 --> 29:13.280
Oh my. There's a chamber.

29:31.920 --> 29:32.440
Jinzhao.

29:32.590 --> 29:34.750
Do you think there might
be a Qiyuan Orb here?

29:51.840 --> 29:54.230
Xiu, what is this?

30:02.080 --> 30:03.110
This is the Enchanting Herb.

30:03.440 --> 30:04.710
It can be used
to refine enchanting drug.

30:07.230 --> 30:08.750
I remember we found

30:09.080 --> 30:10.710
this herb in the Fujin Hall.

30:11.680 --> 30:13.230
It seems that Qiyuan Sect's
enchanting drug

30:13.630 --> 30:15.110
is made from this herb.

30:15.840 --> 30:16.960
Although the scent is weak,

30:17.320 --> 30:18.710
Bian Luohuan's house

30:19.280 --> 30:20.470
does have this scent.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.390
You mean...

30:23.630 --> 30:24.990
It won't leave the scent on someone

30:25.390 --> 30:27.470
if he doesn't touch it.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.680
And I've never heard

30:30.800 --> 30:32.110
such herbs grow in the Western Regions.

30:33.350 --> 30:35.440
Qi, was there anything wrong

30:35.510 --> 30:36.680
with Bian Luohuan last night?

30:42.840 --> 30:43.990
Last night,

30:43.990 --> 30:46.590
I fell asleep
in Physician Bian's cottage.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.440
So you wouldn't know

30:50.590 --> 30:51.440
what he did.

30:53.990 --> 30:54.800
Do you think

30:54.960 --> 30:56.870
Bian Luohuan deliberately
let Miss Yue fall asleep?

30:58.590 --> 31:00.710
Little Yue, come up.

31:11.630 --> 31:13.470
Little Yue had been in the cottage
for too long.

31:13.750 --> 31:14.870
There're dozens of scents on her.

31:15.470 --> 31:17.280
I can't tell the specific one.

31:20.230 --> 31:20.920
Well,

31:21.200 --> 31:23.320
maybe we think too much.

31:23.560 --> 31:25.630
Maybe Little Yue was just too tired.

31:26.590 --> 31:28.750
I don't think Physician Bian
is a bad person.

31:28.870 --> 31:30.840
He even helped us save Lang Mo.

31:30.960 --> 31:33.160
Those disciples said something
very interesting before they died.

31:34.280 --> 31:35.280
"That person will kill us."

31:37.390 --> 31:38.960
It means the one behind them

31:39.160 --> 31:40.350
is in Luori Village right now.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.870
And Bian Luohuan is really suspicious.

31:43.870 --> 31:44.920
We can never be too careful.

31:45.590 --> 31:46.870
Just pretend we don't know anything

31:47.080 --> 31:47.960
and observe.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.630
Go get Physician Bian.

32:12.510 --> 32:13.200
Now!

32:23.990 --> 32:25.110
Are they still alive?

32:26.200 --> 32:27.390
Let's get them out of here first.

32:28.510 --> 32:29.320
Let's split up.

32:29.590 --> 32:30.320
You carry them out.

32:30.750 --> 32:31.750
Qi, me and Shifang,

32:32.080 --> 32:33.160
we stay here to search.

32:56.440 --> 32:57.280
There's a box here.

32:57.800 --> 32:59.080
It looks quite special.

33:04.230 --> 33:05.230
This is a gadget box.

33:05.470 --> 33:06.200
I'll give it a try.

33:06.470 --> 33:06.960
Watch out.

33:11.800 --> 33:12.510
Step back.

33:26.510 --> 33:27.110
Watch out.

33:45.920 --> 33:46.800
Qi!

33:52.110 --> 33:52.750
Qi.

33:52.750 --> 33:53.320
Little Yue.

34:04.750 --> 34:07.160
Jinzhao, let Physician Bian
check on Little Yue.

34:15.389 --> 34:16.139
Qi.

34:17.679 --> 34:19.630
Give her the antidote.

34:20.170 --> 34:21.600
It can suppress the poison for now.

34:24.750 --> 34:27.080
Any more hesitation and she'll be dead.

34:31.280 --> 34:31.870
Shifang.

34:33.320 --> 34:33.989
Here.

34:35.510 --> 34:35.920
Qi.

35:00.560 --> 35:02.680
Physician Bian, how is she?

35:03.390 --> 35:04.840
Her condition is stable for now.

35:08.200 --> 35:09.440
What do you mean "for now"?

35:13.040 --> 35:14.630
If it wasn't for you breaking in,

35:15.040 --> 35:16.590
Qi wouldn't have passed out.

35:17.440 --> 35:18.840
If something happens to her,

35:19.280 --> 35:20.920
I will never let you off.

35:21.630 --> 35:22.870
I want nothing to happen to her too.

35:30.710 --> 35:31.320
Qi.

35:32.510 --> 35:33.110
Qi.

35:35.470 --> 35:36.680
I want some water.

35:37.960 --> 35:38.710
You'd take a rest.

35:39.160 --> 35:39.920
I'll take care of Qi.

35:41.750 --> 35:44.800
T-Then we'll leave.

35:49.160 --> 35:49.920
Qi.

35:52.040 --> 35:52.840
Water.

35:53.800 --> 35:54.470
Water.

36:04.040 --> 36:05.670
Here, water.

36:08.120 --> 36:08.750
Mr. Yue.

36:09.880 --> 36:10.990
Is she really your sister?

36:12.280 --> 36:13.360
You're not

36:13.800 --> 36:15.510
acting like an elder brother.

36:44.400 --> 36:46.990
These two seem to be in a pair.

37:03.080 --> 37:04.750
(I am not acting like an elder brother?)

37:09.320 --> 37:12.230
Why is Physician Bian so upset?

37:15.320 --> 37:16.360
Physicians are kind.

37:17.320 --> 37:18.470
Miss Yue is seriously injured.

37:18.640 --> 37:20.750
As a physician, he could do nothing.

37:21.040 --> 37:22.080
This kind of feeling

37:22.510 --> 37:23.750
should be like us

37:23.880 --> 37:25.040
watching the disciples commit suicide,

37:25.600 --> 37:27.230
yet we could do nothing.

37:31.640 --> 37:32.670
I don't think so.

37:38.750 --> 37:39.750
Senior Xian Qing.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.910
Why didn't I see you earlier?

37:42.150 --> 37:44.470
I've put the box in the cottage.

37:44.750 --> 37:45.880
Do you want to see it?

37:47.080 --> 37:48.400
Preoccupied with Miss Yue's injury,

37:48.510 --> 37:49.470
we forgot about it.

37:49.910 --> 37:50.950
Let's go together.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.600
You go first
and I'll be right behind you.

37:54.230 --> 37:54.910
Let's go.

38:10.560 --> 38:12.910
Physician Bian, are you
worried about Little Yue's injuries?

38:14.800 --> 38:15.670
As a physician,

38:16.510 --> 38:18.150
I failed to detoxify Miss Yue.

38:18.600 --> 38:19.910
I'm bound to get a little frustrated.

38:21.840 --> 38:23.360
If those disciples hadn't died,

38:24.320 --> 38:26.080
Zhaoyan could follow the clue,

38:26.600 --> 38:28.800
find out who's behind this
and get the antidote.

38:29.710 --> 38:31.430
This way, Little Yue
wouldn't have to suffer this.

38:33.320 --> 38:36.040
Physician Bian, do you think so?

38:37.560 --> 38:40.150
You seem to be implying something.

39:30.250 --> 39:33.930
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

39:35.280 --> 39:37.840
♪Burns what once was♪

39:39.370 --> 39:42.200
♪The name is forgotten♪

39:46.280 --> 39:49.800
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

39:51.210 --> 39:54.240
♪Only through the eyes♪

39:55.120 --> 39:58.160
♪Who can see them clearly♪

40:00.330 --> 40:06.370
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

40:08.080 --> 40:14.440
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

40:16.300 --> 40:23.790
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

40:24.340 --> 40:30.830
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

40:48.270 --> 40:52.250
♪The seemingly random paths♪

40:53.290 --> 40:56.150
♪The burning traces♪

40:57.230 --> 41:01.200
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

41:04.330 --> 41:08.630
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

41:09.260 --> 41:12.540
♪Are all carefully♪

41:13.320 --> 41:16.780
♪Arranged by me♪

41:18.250 --> 41:25.200
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

41:26.250 --> 41:33.230
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

41:34.250 --> 41:41.840
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

41:42.350 --> 41:49.520
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

41:50.000 --> 41:57.780
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

41:58.250 --> 42:05.800
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

42:06.190 --> 42:14.270
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

42:14.270 --> 42:22.410
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
